{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "Jaa. 21.4 (PTS 1891[1963]: V 419,12)"}
{"id": null, "n": "0073019", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0073019", "type": "mod", "text": "Gandhamādana 譯為香醉山，在雪山之北方。（CBETA 按：漢譯南傳大藏經此頁中缺相對應之註標[19]，今於此處加上[19]之註標。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0131058", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0131058", "type": "mod", "text": "kambojaka 十六大國之一。為四北印度迦境之國名。註：「kamboja 國之人，為由森林捕護野馬之時，於某一場所建立一圍繞之門，於馬飲水之處，在 kevala 草（青苔之一種）上塗蜜，此種草束由水邊之草開始，向圍繞之門處塗置。馬來飲水為美味所吸引，就塗蜜之草而食，次第入於圍繞之場所而行。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001001", "type": "orig", "text": "本篇乃第八十集（Asīti-nipāta）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001002", "type": "orig", "text": "雜寶藏經卷八〔一〇一〕（大正藏卷四、四八八頁）；J. no. 534. Mahāhaṁsa（J. V, P. 354f）; J. no. 502Ḥaṁsa（J. IV, P. 423f）; Jm. 22Ḥaṁsa（Jm. p. 127f）etc 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001003", "type": "orig", "text": "有關射師等不能射如來之譚見 J. VI, P. 129。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001004", "type": "orig", "text": "Jīvaka（Komārabhacca）為歸依佛之王舍城良醫。Bimbisāra 王之子 Abhaya（無畏）王與淫女之間所生。Komārabhacca 之異名，乃為哺育王子之故，或見此小兒之故而如斯云云。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0004005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0004005", "type": "orig", "text": "訂正為 bhante。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005006", "type": "orig", "text": "同偈 Vin. II, P. 195（Cv. VII, 3, 12.）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0006007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0006007", "type": "orig", "text": "調伏此醉象之譚見增一阿含卷第九、Vin II, 195；五分律三、十誦律三六，有部破僧事一九、有部藥事五、鼻那耶五、雜寶藏經八、Dhp. -A. I, P. 140；法句譬喻經三、及其他。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0007008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0007008", "type": "orig", "text": "Cittakūṭa 為繞阿耨達湖（Anotatta）五峰之一。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0007009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0007009", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 ayapaṭṭakena。Text, P. 359 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0010010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0010010", "type": "orig", "text": "Sañcalesuṁ 之略（異本）。註釋中為 Caliṁsu。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0010011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0010011", "type": "orig", "text": "ādīnavaṁ 音韻上成為 adīnavaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0011012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0011012", "type": "orig", "text": "同偈出於 J. IV, P. 426; V, P. 362。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0011013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0011013", "type": "orig", "text": "幾乎出於同上之同偈。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0011014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0011014", "type": "orig", "text": "同偈出於 J. IV, P. 425。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0013015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0013015", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 dāyaṁ。Text, P. 363 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0015016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0015016", "type": "orig", "text": "意義為提頭賴吒（Dhataraṭṭha）與蘇木佳（Sumkga）二人，Dhataraṭṭha 為複數之形。註釋中說為在 Dhataraṭṭha 族所生二人鵞鳥之頭主。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0016017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0016017", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 yam yad āyatanaṁ（Francis）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0016018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0016018", "type": "orig", "text": "此概為 Parakka〔ma〕nto 之省略語。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0024019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0024019", "type": "orig", "text": "八六、八七之二偈出自 Text, P. 381。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0027001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0027001", "type": "orig", "text": "J. no. 533, Cullahaṁsa（J. V. P. 337）；J. no 520, Haṁsa U. IV, P. 423F；雜寶藏經卷八〔一〇一〕（大正藏卷四、四八八頁）。Jm 22, Haṁsa（Jm. p. 127F）參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0029002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0029002", "type": "orig", "text": "gāvuta 一由旬四分之一。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0033003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0033003", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Pādo Cgijjeyya（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0033004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0033004", "type": "orig", "text": "以下三偈亦出於 J. IV, P. 424。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0035005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0035005", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 āpatī（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0036006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0036006", "type": "orig", "text": "Saṅgāhaka-pakkge thito saṅgahaka 由 Saṅgaha 而來之語，指四攝事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0037007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0037007", "type": "orig", "text": "殆於同偈 J, IV, P. 426; V，P. 340 中出。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0037008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0037008", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 tuṭṭhacittena。原文 duṭṭhacittena（有惡意者）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0038009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0038009", "type": "orig", "text": "地獄、餓鬼、畜生、阿修羅之四者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0039010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0039010", "type": "orig", "text": "由原文 Saṁyamāno（自制）而來 Samyama 之語，為國王之名故，此處出以現在分詞之形，實為指 Saṁyana 王之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0041011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0041011", "type": "orig", "text": "Sugemā 乃其妻之名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0041012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0041012", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋此為有蠅之肉與無蠅之肉皆食之之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0041013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0041013", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋：「如此之女人依於煩惱之力，對捕捉富者貧者，家世高者或不然者，美者醜者而愛著者。雖是如此惡女，貴君為此女而嘆息……。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0042014", "type": "orig", "text": "出於同偈 J. II, P. 330。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0044015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0044015", "type": "orig", "text": "原文有為 Saññamāno rājā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0046016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0046016", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 ghaṭassito（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0046017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0046017", "type": "orig", "text": "可讀為 adanesanaṁ？（Francis）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0050018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0050018", "type": "orig", "text": "在按取註釋之意，——自己欲思聞法，誘之使來，等同囮（音訛誘捕鳥獸之媒）之鳥獸，以為著名之蓮池，欲聞賢者之法話，以網縛之使受苦者——為所說之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0050019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0050019", "type": "orig", "text": "tidiva 三十三天（Tāvatiṁsa）之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0052020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0052020", "type": "orig", "text": "七六～八一偈出於 J. V，P. 348，又亦出於大致與之相同者之 J. IV, P. 427。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0054021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0054021", "type": "orig", "text": "布施等十種王法（dasa rājadgamā）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0057022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0057022", "type": "orig", "text": "以下二偈出於（TEXt, P, 353）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0057023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0057023", "type": "orig", "text": "訂正為 Saṁyamarāja-Iuddaputehi。見 Text, P354。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0057024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0057024", "type": "orig", "text": "取 Naciraṁ 之 Na。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0060001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0060001", "type": "orig", "text": "J. no. 78. I llisa（J. I, P. 349F）參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0061002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0061002", "type": "orig", "text": "dgutaṅga 亦譯為抖擻、大灑等。善見律毘婆沙卷六（大正藏卷二四．七一二a）中，有云以煩惱之塵垢為抖擻，為於衣食住拂去貪著之行法，於此舉十二頭陀。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0061003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0061003", "type": "orig", "text": "Sārāṇīya-dgamma 此有六種，見 D. III, P. 245; A. III, P 288。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0061004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0061004", "type": "orig", "text": "Koṭi 億，大數之名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0062005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0062005", "type": "orig", "text": "Mātali 帝釋之馭者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0062006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0062006", "type": "orig", "text": "Pañcasikha 從帝釋之樂神。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0062007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0062007", "type": "orig", "text": "Maccgarikosiya 吝嗇之 Kosiya（拘私耶）之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0063008", "type": "orig", "text": "訂正為 Nivesana。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0063009", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 madgu。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0063010", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 anuseṭṭgino（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0065011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0065011", "type": "orig", "text": "Pattga 音譯為鉢羅薩他，譯為斤。量之名。algaka（āḍgaka，阿宅迦）之四分之一。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0065012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0065012", "type": "orig", "text": "Vejayanta 譯為最勝殿，帝釋之宮殿。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0065013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0065013", "type": "orig", "text": "Sudgammā〔-savgā〕三十三天講堂之名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0065014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0065014", "type": "orig", "text": "Paṇḍukambala-Silāsana paṇḍukambala 為赤黃色毛布之意。由此色庂美石所成帝釋之座。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0066015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0066015", "type": "orig", "text": "在原文有為 Maccharikosika。P. 392 中亦有。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067016", "type": "orig", "text": "Mahāvastu, II, P. 49 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067017", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 duvinnan。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0072018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0072018", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 na cāpi, datvā……（Francis）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0073019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0073019", "type": "orig", "text": "Gandhamādana 譯為香醉山，在雪山之北方。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0073020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0073020", "type": "orig", "text": "Dānava 阿修羅之一。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0074021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0074021", "type": "orig", "text": "Purindada 帝釋之異名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0075022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0075022", "type": "orig", "text": "Sudhābhojana 諸神所食之食物。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0077023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0077023", "type": "orig", "text": "ekāsanaṁ 不可解為 eka-asanaṁ 之意，如註釋之誤者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0079024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0079024", "type": "orig", "text": "Kusa 吉祥草。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0079025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0079025", "type": "orig", "text": "masakkasāra 須彌山之頂上，即為三十三天。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0083026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0083026", "type": "orig", "text": "sāmāka 黍之類。nīvāra 粳米。cīnaka 豆之類。moca; kadalī 均為羊角蕉之類。sāli稻。Pavigi 稻之類。ābhuji 樹名。taṇḍula 穀米。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0084027", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0084027", "type": "orig", "text": "cakkavāka 赤鵞鳥，漢譯鴛鴦。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0084028", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0084028", "type": "orig", "text": "jīvajīvaka 譯為共命鳥。雉之類。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0084029", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0084029", "type": "orig", "text": "最後之二句亦出於 J. VI, P. 277。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0084030", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0084030", "type": "orig", "text": "此一句與次偈殆為同一之物，亦出於 J. VI, P. 277。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0084031", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0084031", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Palāsatā（stede）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0084032", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0084032", "type": "orig", "text": "ganin; nika 皆為鹿之類。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0086033", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0086033", "type": "orig", "text": "參照八九偈讀為 Kosiya。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0086034", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0086034", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Suplavantaṁ（stede）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0086035", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0086035", "type": "orig", "text": "jambonada 由閻浮河所採黃金。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0086036", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0086036", "type": "orig", "text": "Canda 在註中有為 Candaka，為孔雀尾上之目。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0086037", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0086037", "type": "orig", "text": "laṅgganaya 不詳，或為鹿之類？但在此處從註釋而為斯譯。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0092001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0092001", "type": "orig", "text": "J no 74 Rukkhadhamma（J. I. P. 3275）Sn-A. p. 3575 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0092002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0092002", "type": "orig", "text": "Rohiṇi 釋迦、拘利兩族，就盧奚多河灌溉所謂有關水論，見 J. I. P. 327. J. IV, P. 207, Ṣn. -A. , 3575, ṃanora-thapūnani, P772 等。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0092003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0092003", "type": "orig", "text": "Jeṭṭha（-mūla）相當五～六月。但西域記卷二以第三月為逝瑟吒，即相當於三月十六日～四月十五日之間。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0093004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0093004", "type": "orig", "text": "釋迦族及拘利族皆為剎帝利，即是王族。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0093005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0093005", "type": "orig", "text": "Kala 棗樹，拘利族（Koliya）之名，據云因此拘羅樹而發生。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0093006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0093006", "type": "orig", "text": "cumbaṭa 載壺等於頭上運行場合，用敷布為台卷成幾層而成圖形。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0094007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0094007", "type": "orig", "text": "Vūhasammisati 或訂正為 -Samiss-。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0094008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0094008", "type": "orig", "text": "Attdaṇḍa-Sutta sn; IV, 15（P. 1825）漢譯義足經卷下（16）維樓勒王經（大正藏卷四、一八八a）與此相當。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0094009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0094009", "type": "orig", "text": "Kesa-saṁsi 由頭髮發出光線之意。J. I. P. 327 中有 nīla-naṁsi（紺青之光線）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0095010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0095010", "type": "orig", "text": "原文以下皆為單數之呼格，因繫指釋迦及拘利兩族之諸王族之意，故譯為複數。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0096011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0096011", "type": "orig", "text": "在此處有 Vaṭṭaka-jātaka，此勿寧為 J, no, 33, Sammodamāna（J. I, P. 2085.）與此相當。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0096012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0096012", "type": "orig", "text": "Mahāvana 譯為大林。在 D, 20. mahāsamaya（D. II, P. 253）言為在迦維羅衛城外。漢譯有迦維林或迦維羅林等。此處概為指此之森，尚且毘舍離亦有同名之森林。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0097013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0097013", "type": "orig", "text": "由雪山流出之五大河為 Gaṅga（恆伽）、yamuña（搖尤那）、Aciravatī（阿夷羅婆提）、Sarabhū（舍山牛浮）、makī（摩企）等。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0098014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0098014", "type": "orig", "text": "Kakila 譯為好聲鳥，即印度產之郭公鳥。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099015", "type": "orig", "text": "uddākā 英譯為獺。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099016", "type": "orig", "text": "nelamaṇḍada 註釋云為 mahābilāra（大貓），更解為青年子象之羣（taruṇa bhinkācchapa maṇḍala）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099017", "type": "orig", "text": "mahāvarāha 註釋有 mahāhatthi，但 varāha 乃豬之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099018", "type": "orig", "text": "nāha 一般謂為象，亦有種種稱呼，即 nāga, hatthin, gaja, kuñjara, dantin, mātaṅga, vāraṇa 等。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099019", "type": "orig", "text": "Purisallu 註釋有馬面之夜叉。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099020", "type": "orig", "text": "Kiṁpurisa = kimnara 譯為人非人，住於深山人面鳥身之妖精，善巧為歌，云為樂神。註釋舉 deva-kinnara, duma, kinnara 等類。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099021", "type": "orig", "text": "yakkga 具有神力之一切精神（spirit）。如木精（樹神）等是。具有與人禍福之神性，為俗信之對象，後被看做是一種之鬼。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099022", "type": "orig", "text": "Pādapa 為「由足根飲食之意」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099023", "type": "orig", "text": "Vānaṇa 有如象鼻嘴之兀鷹。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099024", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 garabhuta。（stede）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099025", "type": "orig", "text": "於原文中舉出 hema 及 kanaka 二者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100026", "type": "orig", "text": "labuja 麵包樹。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100027", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100027", "type": "orig", "text": "nalikera 椰子樹。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0101028", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0101028", "type": "orig", "text": "agalu 香樹，或與伽羅，黑沈香相當。但一般謂為伽羅 tagara 之略音。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0101029", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0101029", "type": "orig", "text": "mahāraga 大蛇之意，為大蟒神。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0106030", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0106030", "type": "orig", "text": "以口與四足為手之用，有五根之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107031", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0107031", "type": "orig", "text": "註釋於此處揭櫫大鵝本生史話 mahāhaṁsa-jātaka 第三之偈。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107032", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0107032", "type": "orig", "text": "nāvasamākatā 意義不明。恐為此形式上之錯誤。此處解作與散文 avisesakara 為同一意義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0108033", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0108033", "type": "orig", "text": "以下五種之說話，原典中插入為註釋。然在 kuṇāla-jātaka（鳩那羅本生史話）中，史話之本文與註釋部分辨別困難之關係，如其後所見種種本生史話揭櫫說明，因此等史話之形與此種史話同樣關係，故於此處譯出。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0108034", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0108034", "type": "orig", "text": "paṇḍu paṇḍu 王及五王子之事，此在 mahābhārata 中曾經說示。而於此處選婿者為pañcāla 之王女 dranpadī。此一史話明顯取材於 mahābhārata。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0111035", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0111035", "type": "orig", "text": "maṇḍapa 祭等之場合所建一時之假屋。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0111036", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0111036", "type": "orig", "text": "於 so 之次加入 taṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0112037", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0112037", "type": "orig", "text": "讀者 surādhuttako（異本），英譯為 tulāputto（金細工人）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0113038", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0113038", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 tatiyavatthusmiṁ（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0113039", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0113039", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 catukkavatthusmiṁ（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0113040", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0113040", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 cārentasa（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0114041", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0114041", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 saeva（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0114042", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0114042", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為 bahakaṁ gantvā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0116043", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0116043", "type": "orig", "text": "取 bhañjanti（√bhañj）之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0116044", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0116044", "type": "orig", "text": "應讀為-dhane，註釋則取其意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0116045", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0116045", "type": "orig", "text": "應讀為 hapakaṁ（＜√hā）（kern）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0117046", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0117046", "type": "orig", "text": "解作 paṇidhānena 之意（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0117047", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0117047", "type": "orig", "text": "adāsa 自由人，非奴隸之男。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0117048", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0117048", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 aviviccaṁ（stede）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0118049", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0118049", "type": "orig", "text": "guyha-bhaṇḍaka 下衣。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0121050", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0121050", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 kaṇṇa-sañkhaliyaṁ（stde）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0123051", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0123051", "type": "orig", "text": "訂正為 laddhuṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0124052", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0124052", "type": "orig", "text": "由脚註異本補充。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0124053", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0124053", "type": "orig", "text": "由脚註異本補充。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0127054", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0127054", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 cintetvā（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0128055", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0128055", "type": "orig", "text": "Rājūnaṁ 為補充（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0129056", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0129056", "type": "orig", "text": "此處有 pāvāsika。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0130057", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0130057", "type": "orig", "text": "馬夫與后妃之地位，兩者比失之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0131058", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0131058", "type": "orig", "text": "kambojaka 十六大國之一。為四北印度迦境之國名。註：「kamboja 國之人，為由森林捕護野馬之時，於某一場所建立一圍繞之門，於馬飲水之處，在 kevala 草（青苔之一種）上塗蜜，此種草朿由水邊之草開始，向圍繞之門處塗置。馬來飲水為美味所吸引，就塗蜜之草而食，次第入於圍繞之場所而行。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0134059", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0134059", "type": "orig", "text": "彼處有蛇入，又為敵人之創投置之故。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0135060", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0135060", "type": "orig", "text": "此註為說 ummadantī-jātasa（蓮華色比丘尼前生）（NO. 527）之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0135061", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0135061", "type": "orig", "text": "此註為說 Naḷinikā-jātaka（那麗尼卡姬本生）（NO. 526）之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0135062", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0135062", "type": "orig", "text": "此註為說 Nanda（難陀）長老之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0137063", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0137063", "type": "orig", "text": "同偈亦出於 J. V. P. 94。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0138064", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0138064", "type": "orig", "text": "同偈亦出於 J. II. P. 326. IV, P. 471。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0138065", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0138065", "type": "orig", "text": "同偈亦出於 J. II. P. 330. IV, P. 471。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0138066", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0138066", "type": "orig", "text": "同偈亦出於 J. II. P. 326. IV, P. 471。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0139067", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0139067", "type": "orig", "text": "bimba 持真紅之果。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0139068", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0139068", "type": "orig", "text": "saṁvara 阿修羅王之名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0140069", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0140069", "type": "orig", "text": "陀那婆入女於籠中嚥入腹內，雖然預為守護，但終不能護女。出於 J. III. No. 436. Samugga-jātaka（P. 527）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0140070", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0140070", "type": "orig", "text": "如註釋中有 Hārita-Lomasakassapa-kusarāano。此中就 gasta 見 J. III. No. 431（P. 496）；就 Lamasahassapa 見 J. III, No. 433（P. 514）；就 Kusa（Kusa）見 J. V, NO. 531（P. 728）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0140071", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0140071", "type": "orig", "text": "Rāhu（羅睺）阿修羅王捕月之故而起月蝕。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0140072", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0140072", "type": "orig", "text": "Namuci 惡魔（māsa）之別名，註釋有 Kilesamāra（煩惱魔）。見 Sn-A. P. 386。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0141073", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0141073", "type": "orig", "text": "Patāpana 八大地獄之一。見前之 Saṅkicca-jā（NO. 530）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0141074", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0141074", "type": "orig", "text": "Simbalivana 小地獄之一，被列舉於（M. 130）相當於漢譯之十六小地獄中之劍樹（長阿含三〇世紀經）。參照前 sankicca-jātaka。（據云由 Vetaranī 之兩岸垂下鐵 simbali樹。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0141075", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0141075", "type": "orig", "text": "Nandana 歡喜苑，為三十三天神苑之一。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0143076", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0143076", "type": "orig", "text": "mahāsamaya-sutta（大會經）D. 20（II. P. 2535）漢譯南傳藏八，二一一參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0150001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0150001", "type": "orig", "text": "cp, 32, sutasoma, Jātakamālā 31sutasoma（P, 207），六度集經卷四（41）普明王經（大正藏卷三、二二b），菩薩本行經卷下（大正藏卷三、一一九b），賢愚經卷十一（二五）無惱指鬘品（大正藏卷四、四二三b）失譯雜譬喻經卷上（八）（大正藏卷四、五〇三e）僧伽羅剎所集經卷上（大正藏卷四、一一六a），智慧論卷四（大正藏卷二五、八八c）等參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0150002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0150002", "type": "orig", "text": "Aṅgulimāla 譯為指鬘。言為殺人以其指作鬘。後為佛所化，得應果。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0150003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0150003", "type": "orig", "text": "Argulimāla Sutta M 86（M, II, P, 97）與此相當漢譯雜阿含卷三十八（大正藏卷二、二八〇c），別雜卷一（大正藏卷二、三七八b），鴦掘摩經（大正藏卷二、七一九b）等。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0159004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0159004", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋補足。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0163005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0163005", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋補足。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0165006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0165006", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋補足。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169007", "type": "orig", "text": "agghapadalakkhaṇa「不知測量價值之特相。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169008", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 karandaka（異本）。一種之灌木。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0171009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0171009", "type": "orig", "text": "nakkhatta 所謂二十八宿，依其運行判別占算下界一切發生之事故。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0172010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0172010", "type": "orig", "text": "phussa-nakkhatta 南方七宿之鬼宿。音譯為富沙弗沙星、佛星、學星等。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0172011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0172011", "type": "orig", "text": "訂正為 salāhabhattaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0173012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0173012", "type": "orig", "text": "hattha 為由肘到中指尖端之長度。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0175013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0175013", "type": "orig", "text": "以下之二偈亦出於 J, V, P, 24。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0175014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0175014", "type": "orig", "text": "最初之二偈亦出於 J, V, P. 23。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0176015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0176015", "type": "orig", "text": "同偈亦出於 J, IV, P. 462。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0176016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0176016", "type": "orig", "text": "為與婆羅門果約之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0179017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0179017", "type": "orig", "text": "同偈亦出於 S. I. P. 17。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0181018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0181018", "type": "orig", "text": "最初之二句亦出於 J, V, P. 289。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0184019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0184019", "type": "orig", "text": "註釋中有：「五五與象等十種有情由肉所成之故（maṁsamayena）不可噉食，非可噉之物。」而尚有別解：「知剎帝利法之剎帝利，在持五爪有情之中，鬼、箭豬（sallaka）大蜥蜴、山豬（讀為 savi）及龜山五種之有情可以噉食，其他則不可噉食。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0185020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0185020", "type": "orig", "text": "nakkhattadhamma 對此大菩薩之答覆 khattadhamma（統治之法）之意。是故 nakhattadhamṁe kusalo 可讀為（統治之法不道）之意耶？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0188021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0188021", "type": "orig", "text": "以下四偈為四〇～四三偈之返復。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0188021", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0188021", "type": "mod", "text": "以下四偈為四〇【南傳】，～四三偈之返復。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0192022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0192022", "type": "orig", "text": "同偈亦出於 J, III, P. 280。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0195023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0195023", "type": "orig", "text": "Pañcapatiṭṭgitena vanbait 額、腰、肘、膝、足著地為禮。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0197024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0197024", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 ne（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0203025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0203025", "type": "orig", "text": "註釋為說父母之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0204026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0204026", "type": "orig", "text": "Vedikā 為環繞神詞、聖處、聖樹、聖物等周圍之一種玉垣。在佛教多環繞於塔之周圍，現於印度得見其古代之例如 Bhāsrhut sānchī Amarāvati 等。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0204027", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0204027", "type": "orig", "text": "kammāsadamma-nigama 譯為伏鬼街？食人者即為鬼（kammāsapada）持有斑之足之調伏街之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0208001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0208001", "type": "orig", "text": "本篇為 Mahānipāta（大集）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0208002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0208002", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本題為 Temiya-jātaka。Gp. 26, Temiya；六度集經四、（三八）太子墓魄經（大正藏卷三、二〇b）太子墓魄經（大正藏卷三、四〇八b 別譯四一〇a）。此浮彫圖存在於 Bharhut（Barāhat）；題為 Muga-pakiya（Cunningham, PL. XXV, 4）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0208003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0208003", "type": "orig", "text": "Pāramī（or pāramitā）度，譯為到彼岸，為菩薩之大行。依此行事，得度涅槃之彼岸。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0209004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0209004", "type": "orig", "text": "Uposatga 月之新月、滿月之日及其中間之日（八日、二十三日）為安息日，印度古來之習慣作為齋日。此日休業、持戒、斷食慶祝，以此儀式謂之布薩。在佛教出家者普通四人以上共住，以為說戒懺悔之儀式，在家者受八齋戒，終日住於清淨。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0209005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0209005", "type": "orig", "text": "Saccakiriya 真實之所作，真實事。真實與否為自己衡量而作成誓言。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0210006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0210006", "type": "orig", "text": "Nātha 守護者領主等之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0210007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0210007", "type": "orig", "text": "依異本讀為 pakkhapāda。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0210008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0210008", "type": "orig", "text": "以須彌山為中心之一世界人間居住之地，由四個地方形成，在此處為全世界之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0211009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0211009", "type": "orig", "text": "Setachatta 白傘蓋為王位之標幟，王之上常掛起此一傘蓋。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0214010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0214010", "type": "orig", "text": "在此有苦之世不作幾次之輪迴再生。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0214011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0214011", "type": "orig", "text": "此一行乃由異本補足。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0215012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0215012", "type": "orig", "text": "Pgaṇa 展開龍頭部之貌。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0217013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0217013", "type": "orig", "text": "Gūthaniraya 糞尿地獄。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0217014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0217014", "type": "orig", "text": "Avīciniraya 無間地獄，八熱地獄之一，極苦之地獄。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0217015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0217015", "type": "orig", "text": "Jambudīpa 贍部洲，須彌山南之一洲，說明為我等人間居住之處，其形略為三角，人壽百歲。此即為印度之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0221016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0221016", "type": "orig", "text": "Vissakamma 諸神之大工。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223017", "type": "orig", "text": "Gandhabba 譯為食香、香陰等，亦有香神、樂神、執樂天之稱，乃帝釋天之音樂神。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223018", "type": "orig", "text": "purindada Sakka 之形容語，見 Puraṁ√dṛ 城砦破壞者之意。然「在市街布施之故，被稱為 Purindada」（Vimāna Vatthu-A. P. 171）之說，見 pure √dā，同樣之說明亦見於 Dgp. -A, I. P. 185。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223019", "type": "orig", "text": "此一句見 Petavatthu P. 24。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223020", "type": "orig", "text": "此偈見 J. V, P. 240; Petavatthu. P23。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0224021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0224021", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋此為就 Sīvalī（比丘尼）之事說明者 Dhp. A. II, P. 196; J. VI, P. 30F（Mahājanaka）參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0224022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0224022", "type": "orig", "text": "註釋云為 Sankicca-Sāmaṇera（仙人）之事。Dhp. A. II, P. 240F 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0224023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0224023", "type": "orig", "text": "在註釋中為 Jotipāla 之事（司祭之子，佛之前生）。D. II, P. 230F（mahāgovinda）；長阿五（典尊經）（大正藏卷一、三〇b）Jotipāla（焰鬘）參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0224024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0224024", "type": "orig", "text": "在註釋中為 Citta-gahapati（比丘尼）Dhp. -A. , II. P. 74F 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0224025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0224025", "type": "orig", "text": "註釋為 Anātgapiṇḍika 之事。S. 10. 8. 及其註，雜阿二二（大正藏卷二、一五七b）Vin. CV. VI, A. P. I；四分律五〇（大正藏卷二二、九三八b）等參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0225026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0225026", "type": "orig", "text": "註釋中有說為 Cullapaduma-jātaka no. 193.（J. II. P. 115）（小蓮華王本生譚）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0225027", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0225027", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋 Kuraraggariya-Soṇattgera 之母之家（拘羅羅家）有盜賊侵入之事。Dhp. -A. IV, P. 101F（Kuraraghara Soṇakoṭikaṇṇa《摩訶迦旃延弟子》之母參照）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0226028", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0226028", "type": "orig", "text": "ratha 但應讀為 raṭṭha？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0231029", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0231029", "type": "orig", "text": "依埋殺而使土增殖之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0233030", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0233030", "type": "orig", "text": "assama, or assamapada 在一定之區域內為仙人度日而有適當之種種建築物（葉庵）場所物等設備之仙處。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0233031", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0233031", "type": "orig", "text": "jaṭāmaṇḍala 螺髻之環。螺髻是將頂髮結為螺見之形。婆羅門稱謂結螺髻祭火之隱者之羣為 jaṭila，譯為螺髮梵士。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0235032", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0235032", "type": "orig", "text": "Sindhu 西方印度之國，產駿馬而有名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0235033", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0235033", "type": "orig", "text": "Seṇi 所謂比擬吉爾持（guild）之一種同業組合。在本生譚（jātak a）十八種之中，不過舉出四種。即大工、鐵工、製皮、繪書。Cambridge History I. P. 206（C. A. F. Rgys. Davids）參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0237034", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0237034", "type": "orig", "text": "底本置於註釋之最後，此應入於本文。又為……pallaṅke na nisi i P. 24 最初之一行，亦為同樣。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0238035", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0238035", "type": "orig", "text": "應讀為 accgerakam maṁ……。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0239036", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0239036", "type": "orig", "text": "註釋中有四人之街市姑娘（Caturā nāgaraka ittthiyo）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0240037", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0240037", "type": "orig", "text": "底本將此文入於註釋之最後。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0243038", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0243038", "type": "orig", "text": "二七、二八之二偈亦出於 J. IV, P. 127。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0244039", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0244039", "type": "orig", "text": "從異本讀為 magātale。如此之告示板結附於殿上廣間之柱上云云，例如在 J. IV, P. 488 所出者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0244040", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0244040", "type": "orig", "text": "Samāpati 依定力而心得平等，身心安和。有八種，云八等至。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245041", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0245041", "type": "orig", "text": "Sīgaladipa（Siṁhala，Siṁhakalpa）僧伽羅、師子劫，為錫蘭島之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245042", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0245042", "type": "orig", "text": "J. IV. P. 490 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0250001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0250001", "type": "orig", "text": "Mahājanaka-jātaka 參照賢愚經八（大正卷四、四〇五b）六度集經一（大正卷三、四a）, S, B. E. L, P. 300 等。有此浮雕圖 Barāhat（Bharhut），記銘中在各人物之上有 \"usukāra, janako rāja, sivali devi\"（Cunningham, PL. XI. IV, 2）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0252002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0252002", "type": "orig", "text": "Kāla campā Aṅga 與（鴦伽）國之首都 Campā 同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0255003", "type": "orig", "text": "Suvaṇṇabhūmi（Suvarṇabhūmi）普通以此為今之 Burma 然可懷疑。（參照 Geiger: Mahāvaṁsa, 英譯 P. 86）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256004", "type": "orig", "text": "Usabna（ṛṣabha）長度之單位，與 20 yaṭṭhi（yaṣṭi）相當。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256005", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Loṇodaka。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256006", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 dibba-sampattiṃ（異本）見 text, P 83。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0258007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0258007", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Nipajjapetvā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0261008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0261008", "type": "orig", "text": "Phussa-ratha（Puṣpa. ratha）獨自無馭者而行之不思議之馬車。如意行車。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0265009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0265009", "type": "orig", "text": "hatthatthara 象之被等，馬之被（assatthara）車之被（rathatthara）等省略之故（參照 D. I, P. 7; A. I, P. 181）。在祭日儀式等宮廷之象、馬、車以被裝飾。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0266010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0266010", "type": "orig", "text": "Yugandhara 譯為持雙。為圍繞須彌山七金山之第一，此山與第二 īsadhara（伊沙陀羅）山之間有內海即 Yugandhara-sāgara（由犍陀羅海）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267011", "type": "orig", "text": "以上六偈出自 J. IV, P. 369。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0272012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0272012", "type": "orig", "text": "同一之句出自 J. IV, P. 359。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0272013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0272013", "type": "orig", "text": "CF. J. V, P. 258。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0272014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0272014", "type": "orig", "text": "CF. J. V, P. 259。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0272015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0272015", "type": "orig", "text": "CF. J. V, P. 259。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0280016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0280016", "type": "orig", "text": "CF. J. IV, P. 172。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0281017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0281017", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 bhamara-vaṇṇa（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0283018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0283018", "type": "orig", "text": "同一之句出自 Dhp. V. 200; mahābhārata, XII, 9917, 529, 6641。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0286019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0286019", "type": "orig", "text": "同一之句出自 S. I, P. 7。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0289020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0289020", "type": "orig", "text": "此後之一句出自 J. VI, P. 15。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0291021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0291021", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Paribhunjituṁ arabbhi（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0293022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0293022", "type": "orig", "text": "Dutiya 第二之物。為伴倡，友之意。出家者之原妻謂之 Purāna-dutiyā（故二）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0293023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0293023", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 mā vaca（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0295024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0295024", "type": "orig", "text": "為食事試口洗手及鉢等事終了之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0295025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0295025", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 mā vaca（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0296026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0296026", "type": "orig", "text": "Cetiya（caitya）音譯為支提、制底等。總云廣大禮拜之對象，一切塔（stūpa, thūpa）、聖樹、聖處、聖物等皆是支提。然在狹義則係指特定建造之物，即亦可得謂支提堂。但在此與 thūpo（Stūpa）混同場合，可看作為 Cetiya。Cetiya 由古代以來即存在於印度民俗信仰之中，所謂神詞被信為夜叉之住處。於佛教內與佛相結合之處，一切物皆作為 cetiya 以供養。就此後者而言，見 J. IV. P 228。"}
